s ratio</th><th align="left" valign="top" rowspan="1" colspan="1">p value</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td align="left" valign="top" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Age at diagnosis</td><td align="left" valign="top" rowspan="1" colspan="1">1.008</td><td align="left" valign="top" rowspan="1" colspan="1">0.993&#x02013;1.024</td><td align="left" valign="top" rowspan="1" colspan="1">0.281</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Race</td><td align="left" valign="top" rowspan="1" colspan="1">1.148</td><td align="left" valign="top" rowspan="1" colspan="1">0.919&#x02013;1.435</td><td align="left" valign="top" rowspan="1" colspan="1">0.224</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Baseline IOP (&#x0003e;22 mmHg vs. &#x0003c;22 mmHg)</td><td align="left" valign="top" rowspan="1" colspan="1">1.54</td><td align="left" valign="top" rowspan="1" colspan="1">1.05&#x02013;2.268</td><td align="left" valign="top" rowspan="1" colspan="1">0.028</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Clinic</td><td align="left" valign="top" rowspan="1" colspan="1">1.157</td><td align="left" valign="top" rowspan="1" colspan="1">0.905&#x02013;1.478</td><td align="left" valign="top" rowspan="1" colspan="1">0.244</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Gender (female vs. male)</td><td align="left" valign="top" rowspan="1" colspan="1">0.601</td><td align="left" valign="top" rowspan="1" colspan="1">0.383&#x02013;0.943</td><td align="left" valign="top" rowspan="1" colspan="1">0.0268</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Baseline VF (1 scotoma or worse vs. normal)</td><td align="left" valign="top" rowspan="1" colspan="1">13.698</td><td align="left" valign="top" rowspan="1" colspan="1">4.863&#x02013;38.582</td><td align="left" valign="top" rowspan="1" colspan="1">&#x0003c;0.00001</td></tr></tbody></table><table-wrap-foot><fn id="tfn4-co-2-757"><p><bold>Abbreviations:</bold> IOP, intraocular pressure; VF, visual field.</p></fn></table-wrap-foot></table-wrap></floats-group></article>